[b][size=5]FontAndFlourish[/size][/b]
[i]Created by MTGHillGiant[/i]

[b][size=4]Overview[/size][/b]
Enhances College of Swords Bard and Bardic Inspiration with D&amp;D 2024 spell-slot-to-Inspiration conversion (free action with upcasting) and targeted multi-attack Melee Slashing Flourish.

[b][size=4]Spells & Actions[/size][/b]
[list]
[*] [b]Font of Inspiration[/b] - Harmonize your magical reserves. Expend a spell slot to restore [1] charge of Bardic Inspiration.
[*] [b]Shout_FontOfInspiration_2[/b] - Shout_FontOfInspiration_2
[*] [b]Shout_FontOfInspiration_3[/b] - Shout_FontOfInspiration_3
[*] [b]Shout_FontOfInspiration_4[/b] - Shout_FontOfInspiration_4
[*] [b]Shout_FontOfInspiration_5[/b] - Shout_FontOfInspiration_5
[*] [b]Shout_FontOfInspiration_6[/b] - Shout_FontOfInspiration_6
[*] [b]Slashing Flourish (Melee)[/b] - Attack up to [1] enemies within melee reach, or strike the same enemy twice. Deals an extra 1d6 damage.
[*] [b]Zone_BladeFlourish_Slashing[/b] - Zone_BladeFlourish_Slashing
[/list]

[b][size=4]Passives & Traits[/size][/b]
[list]
[*] [b]FontOfInspiration[/b] - You regain all of your expended uses of Bardic Inspiration when you finish a Short or Long Rest. In addition, you can expend a spell slot with Font of Inspiration to regain Bardic Inspiration uses.
[/list]

[b][size=4]Dependencies[/size][/b]
[list]
[*] [b]GustavDev[/b]
[/list]

